#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Private cross-device associative memory network for Codex.

The hook contract is deliberately narrow:

* never read ``transcript_path``;
* atomically queue a sanitized visible turn before any network operation;
* treat conversations and tasks as provenance, never memory ownership;
* append immutable episodes and evidence-anchored semantic relations;
* recall from a private local index without a prompt-time network call;
* transfer only commit-delta additions after initial indexing;
* perform one bounded publication and at most one concurrency replay.

The module uses only the Python standard library so the same file runs on
macOS, Windows, and Linux wherever Python 3.10+ and Git are available.
"""

